CPLD versions of Mxxx
<UL>
<LI><b>single44</b> is a single-height module using a 44 pin PLCC.</LI>
<LI><b>single84</b> is a single-height module using a 84 pin PLCC.</LI>
<LI><b>single100</b> is a single-height module using a 100 pin PQFP.</LI>
<LI><b>double100</b> is a double-height module using a 100 pin PQFP.</LI>
